      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get the marketing thing, but it's not just random stuff. the way they were positioned felt... I don't know, targeted. like a sequence. if you ignore the retail side and just look at the symbols themselves—the orange of the pumpkin, the blue of the soap, and the cinnamon—is there a deeper connection or a message in that specific combo?",
